In some cases, implant placement under the skin is too thin, we can see that the implant seems to be under fresh skin.
This can also cause the implant to move from one place to another because our skin cannot keep it in place.
Sometimes a nose job can make us see that there is a stick on the nose.
An important feature of rhinoplasty is to make it look natural and avoid the appearance of artificial nose floating on the face.
In addition, another complication is infection caused by the use of non-sterile materials.
It is a real health concern.
It not only loses the beauty of the nose, but can also cause serious infections and even death.
