In the case of a decrease in the structure under the skin that causes our skin to sag under the use of fillers or fat cells make our face sag further down. The weight of those fillers.
The use of fillers should be done with caution, and it is not the first choice in the treatment of Asians who have problems with the formation of oil under the skin or sagging skin.
